Embudo de selección de la cohorte — consultas paso a paso
Cada bloque de abajo es una consulta independiente y completa: cópiala y pégala sola en el editor de BigQuery, dale Run, y verás cuántos pacientes quedan después de aplicar ese criterio (acumulado sobre los anteriores). Todas corren sobre cohort_raw (que ya tiene cada exclusión precalculada como columna booleana) — no necesitas reconstruir nada.
________________________________________
Paso 0 — Sepsis-3, primera admisión a UCI, ≥18 años
(equivalente al recuadro superior de la Fig 1 del paper, N=12,014)
SELECT COUNT(*) AS n_paso_0_sepsis3_first_stay
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`;

________________________________________
Paso 1 — + excluir ICU < 24h
SELECT COUNT(*) AS n_paso_1
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h;
________________________________________
Paso 2 — + excluir creatinina basal faltante
SELECT COUNT(*) AS n_paso_2
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h
  AND NOT excl_missing_creat;
________________________________________
Paso 3 — + excluir eGFR < 15 al ingreso
SELECT COUNT(*) AS n_paso_3
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h
  AND NOT excl_missing_creat
  AND NOT excl_egfr_lt_15;
________________________________________
Paso 4 — + excluir RRT basal (primeras 24h)
SELECT COUNT(*) AS n_paso_4
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h
  AND NOT excl_missing_creat
  AND NOT excl_egfr_lt_15
  AND NOT excl_rrt_baseline;
________________________________________
Paso 5 — + excluir AKI ya presente en las primeras 24h
SELECT COUNT(*) AS n_paso_5
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h
  AND NOT excl_missing_creat
  AND NOT excl_egfr_lt_15
  AND NOT excl_rrt_baseline
  AND NOT excl_aki_baseline;
________________________________________
Paso 6 — + excluir muerte en las primeras 24h
SELECT COUNT(*) AS n_paso_6
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h
  AND NOT excl_missing_creat
  AND NOT excl_egfr_lt_15
  AND NOT excl_rrt_baseline
  AND NOT excl_aki_baseline
  AND NOT excl_death_24h;
________________________________________
Paso 7 (final) — + excluir sin mediciones para diagnosticar AKI
Este número debe coincidir con SELECT COUNT(*) FROM cohort (la cohorte final).
SELECT COUNT(*) AS n_paso_7_cohorte_final
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h
  AND NOT excl_missing_creat
  AND NOT excl_egfr_lt_15
  AND NOT excl_rrt_baseline
  AND NOT excl_aki_baseline
  AND NOT excl_death_24h
  AND NOT excl_no_aki_measurement;
________________________________________
Todo el embudo de una sola vez (una fila por paso)
Si prefieres correr una sola consulta y ver toda la tabla del embudo junta:
SELECT 0 AS paso, 'sepsis3_first_stay' AS criterio, COUNT(*) AS n_restante
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`

UNION ALL
SELECT 1, '+ excl_icu_lt_24h', COUNT(*)
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h

UNION ALL
SELECT 2, '+ excl_missing_creat', COUNT(*)
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h AND NOT excl_missing_creat

UNION ALL
SELECT 3, '+ excl_egfr_lt_15', COUNT(*)
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h AND NOT excl_missing_creat AND NOT excl_egfr_lt_15

UNION ALL
SELECT 4, '+ excl_rrt_baseline', COUNT(*)
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h AND NOT excl_missing_creat AND NOT excl_egfr_lt_15
  AND NOT excl_rrt_baseline

UNION ALL
SELECT 5, '+ excl_aki_baseline', COUNT(*)
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h AND NOT excl_missing_creat AND NOT excl_egfr_lt_15
  AND NOT excl_rrt_baseline AND NOT excl_aki_baseline

UNION ALL
SELECT 6, '+ excl_death_24h', COUNT(*)
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h AND NOT excl_missing_creat AND NOT excl_egfr_lt_15
  AND NOT excl_rrt_baseline AND NOT excl_aki_baseline AND NOT excl_death_24h

UNION ALL
SELECT 7, '+ excl_no_aki_measurement (cohorte final)', COUNT(*)
FROM `akiproject-489303.sa_aki_study.cohort_raw`
WHERE NOT excl_icu_lt_24h AND NOT excl_missing_creat AND NOT excl_egfr_lt_15
  AND NOT excl_rrt_baseline AND NOT excl_aki_baseline AND NOT excl_death_24h
  AND NOT excl_no_aki_measurement

ORDER BY paso;
Esta última te da una tabla de 8 filas, cada una mostrando cuántos pacientes van quedando a medida que se acumula cada criterio — el equivalente visual directo de la Fig 1 del paper.
